scenario: CAM-USB-01
title: USB or built-in camera
area: Camera
rows: F-CAM-02, F-CAM-16, F-HW-03
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: A camera is connected or built in.
step: Open CAMERAS.
expect: The camera is listed by name.
clause: F-CAM-16.listed
step: Open it and look at the live picture.
expect: The picture shows what is in front of the camera, upright, smooth (about 15 pictures a second or more) and in natural colours.
clause: F-CAM-02.live
step: Take a snapshot.
expect: A message says where the picture was saved and the file opens in Files.
clause: F-CAM-02.snapshot
step: Cover the lens, then uncover it.
expect: The picture goes dark and returns; no error stays on screen.
clause: F-HW-03.cover
step: Close CAMERAS.
expect: The camera's indicator light (if it has one) goes off.
clause: F-CAM-02.light
